cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "EK1D-tutorial: a 1-D charge-conserving electrokinetic reactive transport model"
abstract: >-
  A compact, self-contained one-dimensional electrokinetic reactive transport (EKRT)
  model (numpy + matplotlib only) that reproduces the copper-transport and pH-front
  worked example of the accompanying review and demonstrates a twelve-step EKRT
  modelling workflow with verification and mass/charge-balance diagnostics.
